    "problem": "Calculate $\\int csc\u2061x({a}cot\u2061x+{b}csc\u2061x)\\text{d}x.$",
    "solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cot\u2061x+C, \\\\ \\int csc\u2061xcot\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x & =-csc\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int csc\u2061x({a}cot\u2061x+{b}csc\u2061x)\\text{d}x & =\\int ({a}csc\u2061xcot\u2061x+{b}{csc}^{2}\u2061x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {a}csc\u2061xcot\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {b}{csc}^{2}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={a}\\int csc\u2061xcot\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x+{b}\\int {csc}^{2}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={a}(-csc\u2061x)+{b}(-cot\u2061x)+C \\\\  & =-{a}csc\u2061x-{b}cot\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
